{"4864810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wild Hive", "steam_appid": 4864810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4934210, 4970170], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/c64f6caa69cdfc1bee3537bdfaf4eaa7.avif?t=1785832836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras_big/c64f6caa69cdfc1bee3537bdfaf4eaa7.avif?t=1785832836 width=1560 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild Hive is a bee colony roguelite driven by a ruthless honey market.</strong> Grow your hive, hatch a swarm of worker bees, and sell the honey they make on a realistic stock market. <i>The honey quota climbs every year, and the year you miss it, your run is over.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/aefca727e907b5761e3fc2990824c1f3.poster.avif?t=1785832836\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/aefca727e907b5761e3fc2990824c1f3.webm?t=1785832836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/aefca727e907b5761e3fc2990824c1f3.mp4?t=1785832836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must send your bees foraging flowers in procedurally-generated locations, from the safety of Bluebell Woods to the rich, risky Alpine Meadows. Bee careful! They might not return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then sell the harvest when the honey price peaks on the stock market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/9ea9d9c5149e6dbe4a0a80d3a34e54aa.poster.avif?t=1785832836\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/9ea9d9c5149e6dbe4a0a80d3a34e54aa.webm?t=1785832836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/9ea9d9c5149e6dbe4a0a80d3a34e54aa.mp4?t=1785832836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the picture-book art is a deep engine builder. Silo upgrades, Royal Seals, and stock market bets stack into a colony that runs seamlessly, until the wasps come to tear it apart. Workers charge, mercenaries hold the line, and when the last defender falls they go for the Queen. If she dies, so does the colony. Wild Hive offers endless replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/5ec130bf55aa775e87c1cc346e4d92cd.poster.avif?t=1785832836\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/5ec130bf55aa775e87c1cc346e4d92cd.webm?t=1785832836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/5ec130bf55aa775e87c1cc346e4d92cd.mp4?t=1785832836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hatch, feed, and put to work a swarm of cute little bees (with huge personality!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grow your hive and configure it with unlimited possible combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Buy Royal Seals in the shop once a year: permanent modifiers that bend the rules of your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Trade shares in rival hives and lease out your own bees on the RAX (Royal Apiary Exchange).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Settle 5 biomes, from fishing the Mountain Lake to catching apples in the Juicy Orchards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlimited levels and 7 tiers of difficulty to unlock. Each one rewrites the rules against you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Queen bees to unlock and play as. Each Queen has unique attributes and powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Or ignore the quota entirely in Endless mode and grow the biggest hive you can.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild Hive is cozy and cutthroat all at the same time. Build your hive your way and see it thrive or fail.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/c64f6caa69cdfc1bee3537bdfaf4eaa7.avif?t=1785832836\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras_big/c64f6caa69cdfc1bee3537bdfaf4eaa7.avif?t=1785832836 width=1560 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild Hive is a bee colony roguelite driven by a ruthless honey market.</strong> Grow your hive, hatch a swarm of worker bees, and sell the honey they make on a realistic stock market. <i>The honey quota climbs every year, and the year you miss it, your run is over.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/aefca727e907b5761e3fc2990824c1f3.poster.avif?t=1785832836\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/aefca727e907b5761e3fc2990824c1f3.webm?t=1785832836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/aefca727e907b5761e3fc2990824c1f3.mp4?t=1785832836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must send your bees foraging flowers in procedurally-generated locations, from the safety of Bluebell Woods to the rich, risky Alpine Meadows. Bee careful! They might not return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then sell the harvest when the honey price peaks on the stock market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/9ea9d9c5149e6dbe4a0a80d3a34e54aa.poster.avif?t=1785832836\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/9ea9d9c5149e6dbe4a0a80d3a34e54aa.webm?t=1785832836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/9ea9d9c5149e6dbe4a0a80d3a34e54aa.mp4?t=1785832836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the picture-book art is a deep engine builder. Silo upgrades, Royal Seals, and stock market bets stack into a colony that runs seamlessly, until the wasps come to tear it apart. Workers charge, mercenaries hold the line, and when the last defender falls they go for the Queen. If she dies, so does the colony. Wild Hive offers endless replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/5ec130bf55aa775e87c1cc346e4d92cd.poster.avif?t=1785832836\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/5ec130bf55aa775e87c1cc346e4d92cd.webm?t=1785832836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864810/extras/5ec130bf55aa775e87c1cc346e4d92cd.mp4?t=1785832836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hatch, feed, and put to work a swarm of cute little bees (with huge personality!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grow your hive and configure it with unlimited possible combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Buy Royal Seals in the shop once a year: permanent modifiers that bend the rules of your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Trade shares in rival hives and lease out your own bees on the RAX (Royal Apiary Exchange).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Settle 5 biomes, from fishing the Mountain Lake to catching apples in the Juicy Orchards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlimited levels and 7 tiers of difficulty to unlock. Each one rewrites the rules against you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Queen bees to unlock and play as. Each Queen has unique attributes and powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Or ignore the quota entirely in Endless mode and grow the biggest hive you can.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild Hive is cozy and cutthroat all at the same time. Build your hive your way and see it thrive or fail.</p>", "short_description": "Build your own bee hive in this cozy roguelite. Hatch worker bees, forage nectar and sell your honey on the stock market. The royal crown demands more honey every year! How long will your hive survive?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Ita